# @hub-lanes

# ── PR GATE FACTS RECONCILE (BH-4954) ───────────────────────────────────────
# bin/pr-state-reconcile.sh tick — every 15 min, for each repo in
# LEAD_REVIEW_AUTO_REPOS, compare the live GitHub and worker facts of every
# open PR (head, draft, CI green, builder APPROVE, lead verdict, thread HOLD)
# with GET /api/pr-state/gate and write one correcting gate event per stale
# field, capped by PR_STATE_RECONCILE_MAX_PER_SWEEP. It gates no other lane.
# Off via flags/lane-off-pr-state-reconcile. Log: logs/pr-state-reconcile.log.
*/15 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/pr-state-reconcile.sh tick >/dev/null 2>&1
